---
import DemoLayout from '@/layouts/DemoLayout.astro';
import Header from './_components/Header.astro';
import Footer from './_components/Footer.astro';
import Jewel from './_components/Jewel.astro';
import './_components/theme.css';
export const prerender = true;
---
<DemoLayout demoSlug="sunehri-atelier" title="The atelier — Design, materials & care | Sunehri" description="The design vocabulary, materials and care notes behind a fictional Jaipur jewellery collection." fontsHref="/fonts/demos/sunehri-atelier/fonts.css" themeColor="#161d19"><div class="sunehri"><Header active="atelier"/><main><section class="sun-wrap sun-page-head"><p class="sun-kicker">The atelier notebook</p><h1>Less ornament.<br/>More meaning.</h1><p>Sunehri is an imagined small atelier in Jaipur: a study in how architecture, colour and memory can become a personal object.</p></section><section class="sun-wrap sun-editorial sun-section"><div class="reveal"><h2>Drawn from<br/>the city.</h2><p>The Stepwell Edit borrows a descending rhythm. The Pink City Edit brings rose-coloured stones into quiet settings. Everyday Heirlooms pares the idea back to a single line or plane.</p><p>This is an illustrated collection, not a claim of manufactured inventory, artisan employment or heritage credentials.</p></div><div class="sun-arch reveal"><Jewel id="atelier-ring" shape="ring" stone="#c98a92"/></div></section><section class="sun-paper sun-section"><div class="sun-wrap"><p class="sun-kicker">From line to object</p><h2>Three decisions.<br/>Nothing accidental.</h2><div class="sun-steps">{[['01','The silhouette','Start with scale: how a pendant follows a neckline, how a ring sits against a neighbouring finger. The outline must work before a stone enters the drawing.'],['02','The material','The sample palette pairs 18K yellow gold with quartz, onyx and citrine. Stones here are design references; no origin, grading or certification is implied.'],['03','The finish','Brushed planes meet polished edges. Smooth interiors and balanced proportions are part of the concept, as important as the front-facing view.']].map(([n,t,p])=><article class="reveal"><p class="sun-kicker">{n}</p><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="sun-wrap sun-section sun-faq"><p class="sun-kicker">A few useful notes</p><h2>Keep the beautiful<br/>things beautiful.</h2><details><summary>How would I care for a piece?</summary><p>Store pieces separately in soft pouches. Wipe gently with a soft cloth after wear and keep perfume, swimming-pool water and harsh cleaners away. Follow your actual jeweller’s stone-specific advice for cleaning.</p></details><details><summary>What should a real quote include?</summary><p>Ask for material purity, net metal and stone weights, stone identification, making charges and tax separately. The prices here are fictional planning examples, with no connection to a live gold rate.</p></details><details><summary>Can these pieces be ordered?</summary><p>No. Sunehri is a fictional website demonstration. All enquiries reach atittle.com about designing a website for your own business.</p></details><details><summary>What about sizing, exchanges and guarantees?</summary><p>No sales, exchanges or guarantees are offered by this demo. For a real purchase, confirm the fit in person and obtain the seller’s written resizing and return terms before paying.</p></details></section></main><Footer/></div></DemoLayout>
